[00:49.27]And not feel depressed
[00:54.30]Life's a round dance we're young and gorgeous
[00:58.79]Step by step moving at the same pace
[01:03.34]Daylight shall come we'll wave goodbye
[01:07.84]But before that we can flame the night
[01:12.26]So let's cross over and over
